        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074750/extras/9bb7b92e626784bafd17837c013c18e3.avif?t=1764597192\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to MafiaPunk.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong><br> <br>This<strong> </strong>is a narrative-driven <strong>turn-based card strategy game</strong> about surviving the modern underworld. <br>Start with nothing but a debt, a job, and a promise to some shady characters. Work for the family that owns you, climb through the rackets, and carve your name into a city that eats people alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn is a new choice.<strong> Drag cards, combine them in verbs, and watch stories unfold</strong> as you build your criminal empire or fall under its weight. <br>Manage your crew, acquire territory, keep your heat low, and watch out for building dissent in your ranks.  <br> <br>Every card is a story; every decision has a consequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074750/extras/dc0e5eef67f28617cda2bfaf77c6e7ec.avif?t=1764597192\" width=1000 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Card Gameplay</strong> <br>Combine cards and verbs as 'recipes' to create actions and new cards</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Actions and consequences told through cards.</strong> <br>Money, crew, influence, and heat: everything is tracked as cards on the board. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thematic Progression</strong> <br>Begin as a small-time driver working off debt and grow into a crime boss commanding a network of territories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fail States with Bite</strong> <br>Three distinct endings await you fi you fail: <i>Prison</i>, <i>Betrayal</i>, and <i>Death</i>. Each has tiers of escalation leading to new ways to defeat them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyber-Noir Visual Style</strong> <br>90's stile anime-inspired artwork meets neon reflection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Sound &amp; Score</strong> <br>Ambient synths and noir soundscapes set the tone for sleepless nights and bad decisions.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074750/extras/9bb7b92e626784bafd17837c013c18e3.avif?t=1764597192\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to MafiaPunk.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong><br> <br>This<strong> </strong>is a narrative-driven <strong>turn-based card strategy game</strong> about surviving the modern underworld. <br>Start with nothing but a debt, a job, and a promise to some shady characters. Work for the family that owns you, climb through the rackets, and carve your name into a city that eats people alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn is a new choice.<strong> Drag cards, combine them in verbs, and watch stories unfold</strong> as you build your criminal empire or fall under its weight. <br>Manage your crew, acquire territory, keep your heat low, and watch out for building dissent in your ranks.  <br> <br>Every card is a story; every decision has a consequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074750/extras/dc0e5eef67f28617cda2bfaf77c6e7ec.avif?t=1764597192\" width=1000 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Card Gameplay</strong> <br>Combine cards and verbs as 'recipes' to create actions and new cards</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Actions and consequences told through cards.</strong> <br>Money, crew, influence, and heat: everything is tracked as cards on the board. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thematic Progression</strong> <br>Begin as a small-time driver working off debt and grow into a crime boss commanding a network of territories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fail States with Bite</strong> <br>Three distinct endings await you fi you fail: <i>Prison</i>, <i>Betrayal</i>, and <i>Death</i>. Each has tiers of escalation leading to new ways to defeat them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyber-Noir Visual Style</strong> <br>90's stile anime-inspired artwork meets neon reflection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Sound &amp; Score</strong> <br>Ambient synths and noir soundscapes set the tone for sleepless nights and bad decisions.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "MafiaPunk is a turn based card-driven narratvie game about building a crime family from nothing. Make deals, settle scores, and climb the ladder of organized crime in a city that never forgets. Forge new cards by combining existing ones to enact new actions on your way to the top.",
